# E §6.3 (round 12): "A place of unit any gives one ledger per unit, in the order of the units' ids". shop is an
# outside place of unit any; pay (100.00 PLN) and epay (20.00 EUR) run into it on the 5th; the statement covering shop
# in February has pay's row at 110.00 PLN and epay's at 20.00 EUR on the 6th: ledger EUR first (difference 0.00, timing
# +1 days), then PLN (110.00 - 100.00 = +10.00). The layout is this interpreter's. (Writer 5's T-101.)
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source plan "plan"
source wyciag "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
input bank: observed
input pln_amt: money PLN
input eur_amt: money EUR
input dom: int
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place ekonto: accounts EUR lives 2019-05-01..
place shop: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to shop amount pln_amt

move epay[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from ekonto to shop amount eur_amt

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  pln_amt = 100.00 PLN "umowa"
  eur_amt = 20.00 EUR "umowa"
  dom = 5 "umowa"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  opening[ekonto] = 1 000.00 EUR at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version st
  cite wyciag
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers shop
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to shop amount 110.00 PLN, fulfils: pay[2026-02]) "l1"
  bank[r2] = (on: 2026-02-06, kind: transfers, leg cash from ekonto to shop amount 20.00 EUR, fulfils: epay[2026-02]) "l2"

ask led: residuals shop 2026-02
=== expect
led: residuals shop 2026-02
  ledger EUR:
    2026-02 move epay: model 20.00 EUR, observed 20.00 EUR, difference 0.00 EUR
      matched epay[2026-02] on 2026-02-05: model 20.00 EUR, observed 20.00 EUR, difference 0.00 EUR, timing +1 days
  ledger PLN:
    2026-02 move pay: model 100.00 PLN, observed 110.00 PLN, difference 10.00 PLN
      matched pay[2026-02] on 2026-02-05: model 100.00 PLN, observed 110.00 PLN, difference 10.00 PLN, timing +0 days
  cut 2026-10-20
...
